# Go stdlib `mime` DoS, landed in Trivy's DB ~2026-06-06. Unlike the stdlib
# entries above, the fix is NOT in any released Go version yet — golang/go#79217
# is FixPending, milestone Go 1.27 — so it flags BOTH our own nhp-server binary
# (Go 1.26.3) and the vendored Traefik v3.6.16 binary, and no toolchain bump
# clears it today. Remove after a fixed Go release ships and GO_VERSION is
# bumped. Tracked in #2357.
